{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"11":"The Rites of Hajj (Kitab Al-Manasik Wa'l-Hajj)"},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":1721,"hadithnumber_last":2045,"arabicnumber_first":1721,"arabicnumber_last":2045,"name_native":"كتاب المناسك والحج"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1804,"arabicnumber":1804,"text":"حدثنا ابن معاذ، اخبرنا ابي، حدثنا شعبة، عن مسلم القري، سمع ابن عباس، يقول اهل النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم بعمرة واهل اصحابه بحج","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Muslim (1238)"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":84}}]}